     A** WORKERS' COMP EMPLOYER DISCOUNT DETAIL FILE
     A**
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDS01                     TEXT('EMPLOYER DISCNT DETAIL FILE')
     A*** KEY FIELDS:
     A            DSCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            DSFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            DSFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            DSEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            DSDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A*** ESTIMATED DISCOUNT: EACH DIVISION
     A            DSSTPR    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('EST DIV STD PREM')
     A            DSEDIS    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('EST DIV DISCOUNT')
     A*** ESTIMATED DISCOUNT: ALL DIVISIONS
     A            DSTEPR    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('EST TTL STD PREM')
     A            DSTEDS    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('EST TTL DISCOUNT')
     A            DSEPCT    R               REFFLD(PC52)
     A                                      COLHDG('EST DISCOUNT %')
     A*** AUDITED DISCOUNT: EACH DIVISION
     A            DSANSP    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD ANN DIV STD PREM')
     A            DSACSP    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD ACT DIV STD PREM')
     A            DSADIS    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD DIV DISCOUNT')
     A*** AUDITED DISCOUNT: ALL DIVISIONS
     A            DSTANP    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD ANN TTL STD PREM')
     A            DSTACP    R               REFFLD(A112)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD ACT TTL STD PREM')
     A            DSAPCT    R               REFFLD(PC52)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUD DISCOUNT %')
     A*** MAINTENANCE FIELDS:
     A            DSSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            DSUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            DSPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            DSTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            DSDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
